T1  - Trustworthy distributed mirror learning for secure and private multi-agent coordination
AU  - Wei, Suhang
AU  - Jia, Jinfang
AU  - Feng, Xiang
AU  - Yu, Huiqun
JO  - Engineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence
VL  - 163
